A note on what this licence covers and what it does not.

It covers the two prompts, the tooling in `tools/`, the documentation, and the
example landing pages in `examples/`.

It does not grant any right to the businesses whose public information appears
in the examples. Names, addresses, phone numbers, prices and opening hours in
`examples/` were taken from publicly available listings at the time of writing
and remain the property of those businesses. They are reproduced here for
demonstration. Do not present them as your own, and delete or replace them with
your own client data before you ship anything.